SUMMARY:Door 7: Call back before you pay
DESCRIPTION:DO: Verify urgent payments and bank-detail changes by calling a
  number you already trust.\nDON’T: Move money on the strength of a video
  call - faces and voices can be faked in real time.\n\nLesson learnt (Arup
 \, 2024): An employee joined a video call with deepfaked senior colleagues
  and made transfers totalling about US$25 million.\n\nOpen the door: https
 ://aware-by-design.github.io/CyberAIAdvent2026/?day=7\n\nAI-assisted · an
  initiative of ENISA’s ARCH AHWG
